      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Runner collects per-request histograms and 1s windows.\nSLA can cancel a run; completion and verdict are separate.\nRestarted active runs are marked interrupted.",
      "originalText": "Runner collects per-request histograms and 1s windows.\nSLA can cancel a run; completion and verdict are separate.\nRestarted active runs are marked interrupted.",
      "rawText": "Runner collects per-request histograms and 1s windows.\nSLA can cancel a run; completion and verdict are separate.\nRestarted active runs are marked interrupted.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "text-0035",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 565,
      "height": 85,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2295,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3855,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Local storage is a demo choice, not an HA database.\nMetrics persist at completion; a crash can lose active samples.\nShowcase hosting uses synthetic browser data only.",
      "originalText": "Local storage is a demo choice, not an HA database.\nMetrics persist at completion; a crash can lose active samples.\nShowcase hosting uses synthetic browser data only.",
